<title>UK: C&amp;W shares gain on China telecom hopes.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W shares gain on China telecom hopes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cable &amp; Wireless Plc shares rose on Friday as a press report renewed hopes the company would secure a potentially lucrative entry into the Chinese phone market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Quoting an official at China's ministry of post and telecommunications, the Financial Times said the Chinese government was considering new legislation to allow the selective opening of its telecoms market to Hong Kong firms.</p>
</text>
